description "Prototype Rogue Assassin Droid

A highly experimental, highly insane, sound-sensitive combat unit engineered for elite hunting.

^2Weaponry:
- Droid Melee 
-- Cripples On Hit
- Prototype Sword (Red Style Only)
-- No Blaster Defense, Saber Defense (1)
-- Low BP, High Swing Speed, 2 Limit Combo
- Frenzied Blaster Fire (DC Carbine 3)
-- 50%+ RoF, 35%- Damage/FP Drain
- Sonic Detonators (3)
- Sonic Trip Mines (3)
-- Tripmines, 20%+ RoF, Causes Sonic
- Crafted Flamethrower
-- Slow Movement, Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- CC Training (3)
- 15% Less KB Taken
- Droid Strength (1)
- Beskar Plating (1)
- Cortosis Lining (1)
- Mag Plating 
- Armor Regen (1)
- Blast Armor
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Environmential Protection (3)
- Echo-Location (Force Sense 2)
- Tracking Beacon
- Battery Recharge (2)"